# Brightfield Mustang: "Whenever this creature attacks while saddled, untap it and put a +1/+1 counter on it" (CR 702.171b, 701.26b, 122.1a).
# Turn 1: Saddle 1 (CR 702.171a) taps *other* creatures with total power 1 or more, so neither the Mustang alone nor Aegis Turtle (power 0) can saddle it.
# Turn 3: Zephyr Sprite (power 1) saddles it (the Turtle is refused as the creature to tap), it attacks, and the trigger untaps it and makes it a 4/4 (Bot2 takes 4).
# Turn 5: unsaddled, it attacks again, stays tapped, grows no further, and Bot2 takes 4 more.

